\subsection{Evaluation}
Evaluating avatar generation models involves assessing multiple dimensions, including geometry accuracy, texture fidelity, identity preservation, temporal consistency, and animation robustness. These evaluations rely on quantitative metrics, qualitative assessments, and ablation studies to comprehensively benchmark performance.

