\begin{proof}
By \cref{corollary: weight formulas pyramidal}, $\phi$ is birational of type $(1,1,2)$. 
In particular, the inverse on each factor of $(\P^1)^3$ is defined by a pencil of surfaces in $\P^3$ (recall \cref{trilinear birational}). 
