\subsection{Procedure of selecting the Candidates}\label{selecting}
% ----------------------------------------------
Applications to \textsf{MICS} are solely allowed between April and September as \textsf{MICS} only starts in the winter term. Within this time frame, the procedure of selecting the candidate is done regularly twice per month. After having filled out the online form and sent the application documents to the student service department, the application dossier is sent to the \textsf{director of studies}. Then, the \textsf{director} decides in collaboration with the Vice-\textsf{director} and the specialization heads that the candidate is either accepted, rejected, or that currently no decision can be made. In the last case, some more information about the candidate is requested. The selection procedure is done twice per month. 

