Figure \ref{fig:generation_dimensions} breaks down the quality decrease across different evaluation dimensions for the ImageBind encoder. CLIP alignment compromises performance across all aspects, but most severely affects Audio Quality (-14.0\%) and Reasoning (-20.4\%). This suggests that alignment sacrifices both low-level acoustic fidelity and higher-level semantic understanding, indicating a fundamental information loss during projection.

