]
\paragraph{\textbf{Finding 4.}} Encoders trained with text exposure (CLAP, Whisper, ImageBind) demonstrate superior generation capabilities in their raw form (GPT-4o scores: 1.92, 1.87, 1.89) compared to those focused on direct audiovisual alignment (AudioCLIP: 1.81, Wav2CLIP: 1.80), suggesting that language representation exposure provides beneficial inductive biases for generation.
\end{tcolorbox}

