% A Problem that Resist MAP-Elites and A Potential Solution: An Investigation in Brain-Body Cooptimization 
% \\
% Where MAP-Elites Fails and How to Solve It: An Investigation in Brain-Body Cooptimization
% \\
% Multi-morphology Controllers Enable MAP-Elites for Brain-Body Co-optimization
}

