%around a hydrofoil interacting with traveling water waves 
in Sec. \ref{sec:practical_issues}. Section \ref{sec:application} displays the performance for the two-phase flow 
around a 3D container ship benchmark exposed to regular head waves. Final conclusions are drawn in Sec. \ref{sec:conclusion_outlook}.

