This section aims at a local$\to$global algorithm for distributed data that allows the modification of an already existing global tSVD without knowledge of the underlying global system matrix. This methodology can then be used to incrementally update a rank-$q$ tSVD as described in the previous section. A recipe for the discrete implementation of the proposed SPTS itSVD strategy is sketched in terms of several pseudo-codes in Algs. \ref{alg:time_integration}-\ref{alg:SVD_adaptive}.
%
