\subsubsection{Overall Reward}\label{dynamic-offline-reward}
The overall reward captures the optimization goal by comprising both objectives as per the current episode's preference $\beta_m$. At an episode $m$, when the state is $s$, and a routing action $a$ is taken, the overall reward is $r^{\texttt{Overall}}$ is defined as:
\begin{equation}\label{eq:overallReward}
r^{\texttt{Overall}}(s, a)= \beta_m r^{\texttt{Energy}}(s, a)  +(1-\beta_m)r^{\texttt{PDR}}(s, a)
\end{equation}

